			<td style="width: 50%;">&#xa0;</td>
			<td style="width: 8%;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="d_2023-01-01_2023-06-30" name="dei:EntityInteractiveDataCurrent" id="c17">Yes</ix:nonNumeric> &#x2611;</td>
			<td style="width: 42%;">
			<p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt;">No &#x2610;</p>
			</td>
		</tr>

</tbody></table>

<p style="margin: 0pt; font-size: 10pt; font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;;">&#xa0;</p>

<p style="font-family: Times New Roman; font-size: 10pt; font-variant: normal; margin: 0pt; text-indent: 27pt;">Indicate by check mark whether the registrant is a large accelerated filer, an accelerated filer, a non-accelerated filer, a smaller reporting company, or an emerging growth company. See the definitions of &#x201c;large accelerated filer,&#x201d; &#x201c;accelerated filer,&#x201d; &#x201c;smaller reporting company,&#x201d; and &#x201c;emerging growth company&#x201d; in Rule 12b-2 of the Exchange Act.</p>

<p style="font-family:'Times New Roman';font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;margin:0pt;">&#xa0;</p>

