<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; "><a id="cashflows" title="cashflows" href="#"></a>RUSH ENTERPRISES, INC. AND SUBSIDIARIES</span></p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><span style="text-decoration: underline; ">CONSOLIDATED STATEMENTS OF CASH FLOWS</span></p>

<p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">(In Thousands)</p>

